    {
      "key": "twitter:790055702207148032",
      "platform": "twitter",
      "id": "790055702207148032",
      "status": "alive",
      "publishedAt": "2016-10-23T05:02:12.588Z",
      "versions": [
        {
          "originalLanguage": "ja",
          "description": {
            "ja": "先日、ハトラ／Okayの展示会に行ってきました。心地良さと枯れぬ斬新さが融合した素敵な場所、ちょこっとお手伝いしてます。",
            "en": "The other day I went to the HATRA / Okay exhibition. A wonderful place where comfort and inexhaustible novelty come together. I helped out a little too.",
            "ru": "Недавно сходил на выставку HATRA / Okay. Прекрасное место, где уют соединяется с неиссякаемой новизной. Я тоже немного помогал."
          },
          "media": [
            "twitter/790055702207148032_CvbXYCxUIAACYXc.jpeg",
            "twitter/790055702207148032_CvbXbE1VMAA_vL3.jpeg"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "twitter:799228235296829440",
      "platform": "twitter",
      "id": "799228235296829440",
      "status": "alive",
      "publishedAt": "2016-11-17T12:30:34.894Z",
      "versions": [
        {
          "originalLanguage": "ja",
          "description": {
            "ja": "【絵柄のまったく違う絵師達が、ポケットモンスター サン・ムーンを描いてみた】\n★ア・メリカ\n★げみ\n★さいとうなおき\n★たるたる\n★どむ\n★ヒョーゴノスケ\n★ヘスン",
            "en": "【Artists with completely different styles try drawing Pokémon Sun & Moon】\n★ America\n★ Gemi\n★ Naoki Saito\n★ Tarutaru\n★ Domu\n★ Hyogonosuke\n★ Hesun",
            "ru": "【Художники с совершенно разными стилями рисуют Pokémon Sun & Moon】\n★ America\n★ Gemi\n★ Наоки Сайто\n★ Tarutaru\n★ Domu\n★ Hyogonosuke\n★ Hesun"
          },
          "media": [
            "twitter/799228235296829440_CxdrJ_UVQAAAgBQ.png"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "twitter:814496337655758850",
      "platform": "twitter",
      "id": "814496337655758850",
      "status": "alive",
      "publishedAt": "2016-12-29T15:40:34.164Z",
      "versions": [
        {
          "originalLanguage": "ja",
          "description": {
            "ja": "12/1発売の『ILLUSTRATION 2017』に掲載させて頂きました、 十人十色の個性溢れる人達が詰まった素敵な本。お見かけの際はぜひよろしくお願いします。　{https://shoeisha.co.jp/book/preview/9784798147567|https://shoeisha.co.jp/book/preview/9784798147567}",
            "en": "I was featured in ‘ILLUSTRATION 2017,’ released December 1. It’s a wonderful book packed with artists full of distinct personalities. If you come across it, please give it a look. {https://shoeisha.co.jp/book/preview/9784798147567|https://shoeisha.co.jp/book/preview/9784798147567}",
            "ru": "Мои работы вошли в «ILLUSTRATION 2017», вышедшую 1 декабря. Это прекрасная книга, полная очень разных и ярких авторов. Если увидите её — обязательно загляните. {https://shoeisha.co.jp/book/preview/9784798147567|https://shoeisha.co.jp/book/preview/9784798147567}"
          },
          "media": [
            "twitter/814496337655758850_C02pmy9UAAA9uEP.jpeg"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "twitter:1073163955281907712",
